 now be switched on and off individually\n- A logout function has been added to the main menu, allowing you to easily switch between multiple accounts\n- The exit function has been moved from the main menu to the login screen\n- A direct link to the license shop has been added to the login screen to provide additional assistance\n- A new main menu environment has been implemented\n- All avatars within the application have been graphically updated (except: Conference hall)\n- The \"University\" presentation location has been graphically updated\n- The external environment of all presentation locations has been graphically adapted\n- The latest version 1.7.0 is still supported (but an update is recommended)", "created_date": 1710429108, "id": "7734149319943260", "version": "1.7.1", "version_code": 158, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "4620877591270464", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "9672477702777069"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "276016494333976"}]}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1699876218, "id": "7259831587375038", "version": "1.7.0", "version_code": 130, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "4620877591270464", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "9672477702777069"}, "release_status